<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia ships 67,000 t of wheat to Thailand.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia ships 67,000 t of wheat to Thailand.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Wheat board (AWB) said on Monday 67,000 tonnes of wheat were shipped last week to six customers in Thailand aboard the vessel MV Arthur Stove, sailing from Port Kembla, New South Wales.</p>
<p>The shipment comprises Australian Standard White, Australian Premium White, Australian Hard and Prime Hard wheat, the AWB said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9372-1803</p>
</text>
